#ASSERT `section 95 excludes evidence of facts showing the meaning or supplying the defects` `s95 ill a $500 or $600`

#ASSERT `section 96 excludes evidence that the language was not meant to apply to the existing facts` `s96 ill the Kranji estate`

#ASSERT `section 97 permits evidence that the language was used in a peculiar sense` `s97 ill the plantation in Penang`

#ASSERT `section 98 permits evidence of facts showing to which person or thing the language applies` `s98 ill a the white horse`

#ASSERT `section 99 permits evidence of which of 2 sets of facts the language was meant to apply to` `s99 ill land at X in the occupation of Y`

#ASSERT `section 100 permits evidence of the meaning of the characters or expressions` `s100 ill all my mods`

#ASSERT `section 101 permits the third person's evidence of a contemporaneous agreement` `s101 ill the tin and credit`

#ASSERT NOT `section 101 permits the third person's evidence of a contemporaneous agreement` `s101 a party gives the evidence`

#ASSERT `sections 93 to 101 do not apply because the question is the construction of a will` `s102 the construction of a will`

#ASSERT NOT `section 95 excludes evidence of facts showing the meaning or supplying the defects` `s96 ill the Kranji estate`
